{"id":"vod_md_6517","vodId":"6517","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"间谍过家家第二季","name_cn":"间谍过家家第二季","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231105-1/2fd5ffb35db14f72917d882205cd1a60.jpg"},"summary":"每个人都有不可告人的一面——这是一个世界各国均暗地里进行激烈情报战的时代。东国（Ostania）与西国（Westalis）的冷战状态已经持续数十年。“黄昏”是西国情报局东国对策科“WISE”的一名优秀间谍。为调查威胁东西两国和平的人物——东国国家统一党总裁多诺万·德斯蒙，上级给予了他一个绝密任务。任务名为：“枭”（Strix）行动。内容是“一周之内组建家庭，潜入德斯蒙儿子就读的名门学校的联谊会”。于是“黄昏”扮演成精神科医生劳埃德·福杰，开始组建家庭。然而，他找来的女儿阿尼亚是个能读心的超能力者，妻子约尔是个杀手。三人利害关系一致，便互相隐瞒身份，开始了共同生活。世界的和平，就掌握在这意外不断的临时一家人手中。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"喜剧,动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-02-14 14:00:37","episodeCount":12,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231104/G9sRIc3n/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231104/4gLPIAN8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231104/stVmjCMM/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231104/0NJatNyX/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231105/1dosUusk/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231111/qEcGanKB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231119/sQTIYDJH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231125/CnFid373/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231203/RhQSWeE0/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231209/EPbIadAr/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231216/ZA2oTEzy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231223/84J7x3x9/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-21T08:56:23.208Z"}